SUMMARY:Spirit Week
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Student Council hosted Spirit Week starting on Monday\, December 15th! Dress according to the schedule below or in uniform if you choose not to participate. Common-sense guidelines apply! \nMonday\, Dec. 15th: Cozy in PJs Day \nTuesday\, Dec. 16th:  Decades Day (choose a decade to dress up as) \nWednesday\, Dec. 17th: Western Wednesday \nThursday\, Dec. 18th: Sports Day or Free Dress \nIf in doubt as to whether an item is appropriate\, send back-up clothing in the event your child is asked to change.
URL:https://sherwoodcharterschool.org/event/spirit-week-7/
CATEGORIES:School Events
END:VEVENT
